*** {{m|Hell Game}}s
}}

== Notes ==
* This trinket can be found from destroying {{E|TNT}} barrels.
** {{dlc|r}} It is also dropped alongside 3 bombs when picking up {{I|Match Book}}.

== Synergies ==
* {{dlc+|a}} {{T|Tick}}: Tick can be removed by picking up Match Stick.
** '''Tick''' + {{i|Mom's Purse}} / {{i|Belly Button}}: Match Stick can no longer remove Tick, instead moving to the second trinket slot even if Isaac already holds two trinkets.{{dlc-}}
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Having either increases the chance of changing the room drop reward to a {{e|Bomb}} to 20% and increases the chance of adding a bomb to rewards to 66%. Having both increases these chances to respectively 30% and 100%.

