== Trivia ==
* The pickup quote is a reference to [[Wikipedia:The Simpsons|The Simpsons]], as in the episode "Das Bus", Ralph eats poisonous berries and says "They taste like burning...".
* This item is used in [[Challenge]] #9 ([[Demo Man]]).
* {{dlc|a}}The Match Stick being able to replace the Tick is a reference to a common remedy for removing a tick from one's skin, which is putting a flame beside it until the tick disengages.

